<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Shanyou HVAC entered into a purchase agreement with
Toshiba Carrier Air Conditioning Sales (Shanghai) Co., Ltd. (&#8220;<b>Toshiba</b>&#8221;) on May 9, 2022, pursuant to which, Shanyou
