<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Shanyou HVAC entered into a procurement contract to
supply air-conditioning equipment to a construction material distribution company on July 6, 2023 for approximately RMB36.8 million (approximately
$5.1 million), subject to price adjustments based on actual products supplied and accepted as determined by the customer. The customer
