<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Our cost of revenues for projects increased by approximately
$5.6 million, or 99.0%, from approximately $5.7 million for the fiscal year ended September 30, 2024 to approximately $11.3 million for
