<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">As a result of the combination of factors discussed
above, our net income decreased by approximately $0.5 million, from approximately $1.5 million for the fiscal year 2023 to approximately
$1.0 million for the fiscal year 2024.</p>

