when it is probable that a liability has been incurred and the amount of loss can be reasonably estimated. For the fiscal years ended
September 30, 2025 and 2024, we did not record any accruals for loss contingencies. In addition, we provide bank guarantees to our customers,
primarily in connection with our sales of products contracts, to secure the performance of our contractual obligations, which were more
fully described under &#8220;<i>&#8211; Bank Guarantees</i>&#8221;.</p>

