then current annua1 salary as of the date of such termination; (2) a lump sum cash payment equal to a pro-rated amount of target annual
bonus for the fiscal year immediately preceding the termination; (3) payment of premiums for continued health benefits under our health
plans for three months fo1lowing the termination; and (4) immediate vesting of 100% of the then-unvested portion of any outstanding equity
awards held by the executive officer. The employment agreements also contain customary restrictive covenants relating to confidentiality,
