    <td style="text-align: justify; width: 24px">&#9679;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">evaluating the independence and performance of, and assesses the qualifications of, our independent auditor, and engages such independent auditor;</td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0 36pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt">&#160;</p>

