<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">Pursuant to the Underwriting Agreement of the Company&#8217;s IPO, the
Company issued to Benchmark and Axiom, in their capacities as the representatives of the underwriters in the IPO, and their designees,
