<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>14.E. Use of Proceeds</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">On April 2, 2025, we completed our IPO in which we
