12024-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_custom_CustomerTwoMember" id="Fact001288" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">13.7</ix:nonFraction></span>% of
total balance of accounts receivable.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

