and <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--ConcentrationRiskPercentage_dp_c20221001__20230930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--SalesRevenueNetMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--VendorTwoMember_zpXzdxTTrtBf" title="concentration risk"><ix:nonFraction name="CIK0001979610:ConcentrationRiskPercentage" contextRef="From2022-10-012023-09-30_us-gaap_SalesRevenueNetMember_custom_VendorTwoMember" id="Fact001298" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">23.6</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the Company&#8217;s total purchases.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">As of September 30, 2025, one vendor accounted for
<span id="xdx_900_ecustom--ConcentrationRiskPercentage_dp_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--VendorOneMember_zKIAx7bfqBU" title="concentration risk"><ix:nonFraction name="CIK0001979610:ConcentrationRiskPercentage" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_custom_VendorOneMember" id="Fact001300" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">40.6</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the total balance of accounts payable. As of September 30, 2024, three vendors accounted for <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--ConcentrationRiskPercentage_dp_c20231001__20240930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--VendorOneMember_zhajxv8ef4nc" title="concentration risk"><ix:nonFraction name="CIK0001979610:ConcentrationRiskPercentage" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_custom_VendorOneMember" id="Fact001302" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">28.6</ix:nonFraction></span>%, <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ConcentrationRiskPercentage_dp_c20231001__20240930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--VendorTwoMember_zyVCjQa62kDk" title="concentration risk"><ix:nonFraction name="CIK0001979610:ConcentrationRiskPercentage" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_custom_VendorTwoMember" id="Fact001304" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">22.8</ix:nonFraction></span>% and <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--ConcentrationRiskPercentage_dp_c20231001__20240930__us-gaap--ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis__us-gaap--AccountsPayableMember__srt--MajorCustomersAxis__custom--VendorThreeMember_zKMMbCwjp9wk" title="concentration risk"><ix:nonFraction name="CIK0001979610:ConcentrationRiskPercentage" contextRef="From2023-10-012024-09-30_us-gaap_AccountsPayableMember_custom_VendorThreeMember" id="Fact001306" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Ratio">10.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the total
