<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;&#160;</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2024-10-01to2025-09-30" escape="true" id="Fact001308" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80C_eus-gaap--StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock_zJCwQUAWVhz" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify"><b>Note 12 &#8211; <span id="xdx_824_zjrHf2aJJxu5">Shareholders&#8217; equity</span> </b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="text-decoration: underline">Ordinary shares</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">WF was established under the laws of Cayman Islands
on March 2, 2023. The authorized number of ordinary shares is <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized_iI_c20250930_zh7R5QPXEez3" title="Ordinary shares authorized"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001310" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> with a par value of US$<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--TemporaryEquityRedemptionPricePerShare_iI_c20250930_zNzWikuBSafk" title="Ordinary shares par value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityRedemptionPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001312" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.0001</ix:nonFraction></span>. The issued and outstanding number
of ordinary shares is <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--TemporaryEquitySharesIssued_iI_c20250930_zyI3df6kIs46" title="Ordinary shares issued"><span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding_iI_c20250930_zYC6WnuU2Hm9" title="Ordinary shares outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001314" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30" id="Fact001316" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">100,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span>.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

